<title>FRANCE: CDR sold 21 pct of Casino holding company - source.</title>
<headline>CDR sold 21 pct of Casino holding company - source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>CDR, the state agency grouping bank Credit Lyonnais assets slated for sale, sold the 21.17 percent stake it held in Fonciere Euris, one of the holding companies of retailer Casino, a market source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The source said two block trades for 1.22 million and 492,000 Fonciere Euris shares were exchanged on Monday. The blocks correspond to 21.17 percent.</p>
<p>Fonciere Euris holds 59.40 percent of Rallye, whose subsidiaries include Casino, Go Sport and Athlete's Foot.</p>
<p>Euris and CDR declined comment.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
